AudioWhisper Keyboard: the `palette` crate

This crate is a Rust port of the colour science and scheme generation of
material-color-utilities (https://github.com/material-foundation/material-color-utilities),
by way of MaterialKolor 5.0.1's Kotlin port of it
(https://github.com/jordond/materialkolor). The port keeps their structure,
names and arithmetic, so it is a derivative work of both.

